---
interface Props {
  lang: "en" | "ru";
}

const { lang = "en" } = Astro.props;

const dict = {
  en: {
    svgTitle: "Shutdown with npm as PID 1 loses SIGTERM and ends in SIGKILL after 30 seconds; with tini as PID 1 the signal is forwarded and node drains cleanly",
    headline: "PID 1 DECIDES THE SHUTDOWN",
    sub: "tini forwards + reaps, the app drains",
    badTag: "bad: npm as PID 1",
    badMid: "SIGTERM dies here",
    badSig: "SIGTERM",
    badHang: "hangs",
    badEnd1: "30 s wait,",
    badEnd2: "then SIGKILL",
    goodTag: "good: tini as PID 1",
    goodMid: "forwards SIGTERM",
    goodFwd: "forward",
    goodDrain: "drain",
    goodEnd1: "drain, exit 0",
    goodEnd2: "USER node",
    foot: "grace default: terminationGracePeriodSeconds = 30 s",
    caption:
      "With npm as PID 1, SIGTERM dies, the 30-second grace burns, and SIGKILL drops requests; with tini as PID 1 forwarding to a draining non-root node, shutdown exits clean.",
  },
  ru: {
    svgTitle: "Остановка с npm как PID 1 теряет SIGTERM и кончается SIGKILL через 30 секунд; с tini как PID 1 сигнал пробрасывается и node дренажится чисто",
    headline: "ОСТАНОВКУ РЕШАЕТ PID 1",
    sub: "tini пробрасывает и реапит, приложение дренажит",
    badTag: "плохо: npm как PID 1",
    badMid: "SIGTERM умирает здесь",
    badSig: "SIGTERM",
    badHang: "виснет",
    badEnd1: "30 с ожидания,",
    badEnd2: "затем SIGKILL",
    goodTag: "хорошо: tini как PID 1",
    goodMid: "пробрасывает SIGTERM",
    goodFwd: "проброс",
    goodDrain: "дренаж",
    goodEnd1: "дренаж, exit 0",
    goodEnd2: "USER node",
    foot: "grace по умолчанию: terminationGracePeriodSeconds = 30 с",
    caption:
      "С npm как PID 1 SIGTERM умирает, 30 секунд grace сгорают, и SIGKILL роняет запросы; с tini как PID 1, пробрасывающим сигнал дренажащему non-root node, остановка выходит чисто.",
  },
};

const t = dict[lang];
---

<figure data-lesson-visual class="my-6">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 800 420" role="img" font-family="var(--font-mono)">
    <title lang="en">{dict.en.svgTitle}</title>
    <title lang="ru">{dict.ru.svgTitle}</title>
    <defs>
      <marker id="nd6-a" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="var(--muted)"></path>
      </marker>
      <marker id="nd6-b" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" orient="auto-start-reverse">
        <path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="var(--accent)"></path>
      </marker>
    </defs>
    <text x="400" y="34" text-anchor="middle" font-family="var(--font-display)" font-size="22" fill="var(--ink)">{t.headline}</text>
    <text x="400" y="58" text-anchor="middle" font-size="13" fill="var(--muted)">{t.sub}</text>

    <text x="30" y="98" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{t.badTag}</text>
    <rect x="30" y="108" width="170" height="64" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 5"></rect>
    <text x="115" y="134" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">npm (PID 1)</text>
    <text x="115" y="154" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">node child</text>
    <rect x="300" y="108" width="170" height="64" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 5"></rect>
    <text x="385" y="144" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">{t.badMid}</text>
    <rect x="570" y="108" width="170" height="64" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="7 5"></rect>
    <text x="655" y="134" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">{t.badEnd1}</text>
    <text x="655" y="154" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">{t.badEnd2}</text>
    <line x1="202" y1="140" x2="296" y2="140" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#nd6-a)"></line>
    <text x="249" y="128" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{t.badSig}</text>
    <line x1="472" y1="140" x2="566" y2="140" stroke="var(--muted)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#nd6-a)"></line>
    <text x="519" y="128" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{t.badHang}</text>

    <text x="30" y="228" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{t.goodTag}</text>
    <rect x="30" y="238" width="170" height="64" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2"></rect>
    <text x="115" y="264" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">tini (PID 1)</text>
    <text x="115" y="284" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">--init</text>
    <rect x="300" y="238" width="170" height="64" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2"></rect>
    <text x="385" y="274" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">{t.goodMid}</text>
    <rect x="570" y="238" width="170" height="64" fill="var(--card)" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2"></rect>
    <text x="655" y="264" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">{t.goodEnd1}</text>
    <text x="655" y="284" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--ink)">{t.goodEnd2}</text>
    <line x1="202" y1="270" x2="296" y2="270" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#nd6-b)"></line>
    <text x="249" y="258" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{t.goodFwd}</text>
    <line x1="472" y1="270" x2="566" y2="270" stroke="var(--accent)" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#nd6-b)"></line>
    <text x="519" y="258" text-anchor="middle" font-size="11" fill="var(--muted)">{t.goodDrain}</text>

    <text x="400" y="365" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12" fill="var(--muted)">{t.foot}</text>
  </svg>
  <figcaption style="text-align: center;">{t.caption}</figcaption>
</figure>
